            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review summarizes the salient aspects of the ileal conduit with 3 pedagogical objectives in mind: (1) to describe the surgical steps emphasizing important surgical principles, (2) to provide insight on various preoperative and postoperative considerations, and (3) to summarize the risks of the long-term complications and quality of life. We aim to inform a broad medical readership.</AbstractText>
